   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving advice with sollen",
     "texto": [
      "With **sollen** (should) you give advice without a strong order: **Du solltest mehr schlafen** (you should sleep more). The main verb goes at the end, in the infinitive.",
      "With «Sie» (formal): **Sie sollten viel Wasser trinken** (you should drink lots of water)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
